th/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> therefore,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not continuous and not differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>"
